From 736a9b9a44faafa30b333ebbf86b3b4aefb9522c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Quoc Cuong An <ancuong1610@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 16:38:06 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Show review items, table cells and LLM opinions; add
 workspace import
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- viewer/import_workspace.py: one command turns a saved workspace
  (output/ + source PDFs) into a UI job; workspace is only read
- review items: needs_review tag + plain reason on flagged changes;
  linked review records mark their changes; standalone records (moved
  blocks) become tree items highlighted purple dashed from evidence IDs;
  Needs review chip and filter
- tables: only changed cells filled, whole table outlined; placed in the
  previous section; 'Table · p.N · N cells changed' label
- compact advisory LLM opinion box (outcome, reason, evaluator, element
  IDs; uncalibrated confidence deliberately not shown)
- migration guide updated

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
